        "key_prerequisites": [],
        "has_content_in_snapshot": true,
        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Let&#x27;s evaluate the following exponent:</p>",
            "readable_text": "Let's evaluate the following exponent:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2^{\\color{red}{3}}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2^{\\color{red}{3}}]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We start by writing our exponent as repeated multiplication:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We start by writing our exponent as repeated multiplication:\n[MATH: 3]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Now, we compute the product. </p>",
            "readable_text": "Now, we compute the product.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \\times 2 = 4,]</span> we have\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2 \u00d7 2_(\u23df)_(4) \u00d7 2|= 4 \u00d7 2.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Since [MATH: 2 \\times 2 = 4,] we have\n[MATH: 2 \u00d7 2_(\u23df)_(4) \u00d7 2|= 4 \u00d7 2.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Finally, since <span class=\"math\">[MATH: {\\color{blue}{4}}\\times 2=8,]</span> we have <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2^3=8.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Finally, since [MATH: {\\color{blue}{4}}\\times 2=8,] we have [MATH: 2^3=8.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Raising a number to the power of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span> is known as <strong>cubing</strong> a number. Therefore, the following are equivalent.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Raising a number to the power of [MATH: 3] is known as cubing a number. Therefore, the following are equivalent.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<ul><li><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2^3 = 8]</span></p></li><li><p>The <strong>cube</strong> of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2]</span> is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8.]</span> </p></li><li><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2]</span> raised to the <em>third</em> power equals <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 8.]</span> </p></li></ul>",
            "readable_text": "- [MATH: 2^3 = 8]\n- The cube of [MATH: 2] is [MATH: 8.]\n- [MATH: 2] raised to the third power equals [MATH: 8.]",
            "images": [],
